[{"title":"送黎乐安归越南八首 其七","author":"缪公恩","text":"杯酒相邀强作欢，贺君不敢泪阑干。\n黯然已是悲生别，况复音书一纸难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12601,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送黎乐安归越南八首 其八","author":"缪公恩","text":"赠君玉玦当刀环，去去行旌大惠山。\n为嘱西风秋夜里，好吹清梦度榆关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12602,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画兰送范近光","author":"缪公恩","text":"闻君十载戍龙江，知是徵兰梦渺茫。\n此日承恩归故国，声华应胜畹花香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12603,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村中","author":"缪公恩","text":"柳阴冉冉乳鸦啼，掩映柴扉拂水低。\n何处篴声深绿里，随风断续过桥西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12604,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄普遐亭 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"风流含大雅，吾爱普遐亭。\n笔底开千嶂，行间醉六经。\n联吟听夜雨，共立数春星。\n何日同携手，重倾竹叶青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12605,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄普遐亭 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"目断燕云远，残阳带晚天。\n深情虽欲寄，寸楮未能传。\n六月沧溟息，中秋桂树妍。\n知君驱骥足，已执祖生鞭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12606,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"修理先君子茔墓","author":"缪公恩","text":"佳城凝山脉，长垣绕墓门。\n鸠工劳相度，继绪赖儿孙。\n候雁惊霜信，秋虫泣草根。\n音容何处是，野树掩黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12607,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚眺","author":"缪公恩","text":"村炊敛暮烟，小立晚风前。\n落照收残雨，凉云带远天。\n山空秋漠漠，溪涨水涓涓。\n徙倚青松树，长吟独悄然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12608,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄慰遐亭妹丈下第","author":"缪公恩","text":"李廌居然失主司，北平飞将数尝奇。\n才高岂遂文憎命，器大应知用有时。\n??情怀期视履，沈潜意气且删诗。\n遥看来岁清秋月，折取蟾宫第一枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12609,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北塔","author":"缪公恩","text":"崔巍古塔薄云高，顶上天风振海涛。\n宝月满轮悬北极，大千世界入秋豪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12610,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"懿路道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"挹娄城北晓寒多，霜重羔裘染素罗。\n断塔半留残月影，朔风刮面度泛河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12611,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓行蒲河道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"雪压征尘冷不飞，村墟处处闭柴扉。\n一鞭遥指辉山影，缥缈双峰锁翠微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12612,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜感怀诸友","author":"缪公恩","text":"怀人独对一镫青，寒气侵窗逼画屏。\n万叠云山新旧雨，卅年魏梦短长亭。\n波涛无路通双鲤，零落还愁剩晓星。\n吟望几多离索感，萧萧风雪打疏棂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12613,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮南村归","author":"缪公恩","text":"冈峦积素雪漫漫，古径凝冰策马难。\n得句欲吟吟不得，北风酸鼻逼人寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12614,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"正月十日偶成","author":"缪公恩","text":"天街又见市春镫，丽日晴烟瑞霭凝。\n微度和风门燕舞，乍回阳气纸鸢腾。\n鸡皮不共韶华好，马齿徒随日月增。\n时节惊心聊取醉，银杯有酒大如升。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12615,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日","author":"缪公恩","text":"霭霭和光景物韶，宜人为最是春朝。\n垂杨枝共东风软，小沼冰随腊雪消。\n瓦雀争鸣喧暖日，纸鸢得意入晴霄。\n化机活泼天怀畅，曳屐閒行过石桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12616,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送朝鲜使臣李鲁山高兼之金清山诸君","author":"缪公恩","text":"和光雅度座生春，醉我名言似饮醇。\n笔底莲花开妙舌，胸中菱镜绝纤尘。\n延陵在古多君子，瀛海于今有故人。\n欲问清辉何处是，神嵩东畔望冰轮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12617,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得李鲁山金清山见和之作却答","author":"缪公恩","text":"皇华嘉拜幸如何，得得归骢乐意多。\n白岳晴岚迎使节，绿江秋浪度仙艖。\n钩银画铁今难继，水鸟山云古不磨。\n我愧阳春无妙曲，巴吟远向郢中歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12618,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望虹螺山","author":"缪公恩","text":"群峰负势竞嵯峨，天半岚光翠霭多。\n晓色宜人双眼豁，吕洪山外看虹螺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12619,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阻雨宿三里桥","author":"缪公恩","text":"风雪陵人气欲吞，重阴漠漠冻云昏。\n无眠茅店萧条甚，独对寒檠锁断魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12620,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"抱关岭","author":"缪公恩","text":"冈峦磅礴复回环，石磴崚嶒未易扳。\n后所屏藩开巨镇，长城襟带拥雄关。\n双溪夹绕奔沧海，一岭横盘锁乱山。\n故垒风云怀往事，尚教吟望壮衰颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12621,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"永平怀古","author":"缪公恩","text":"负海凭山古北平，汉时飞将气犹生。\n谁知不具封侯骨，没羽空存石虎名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12622,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉田道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"凝膏冷爓夜迢迢，笼烛鸣鸾驿路遥。\n残梦迷离落何处，晓风吹过彩亭桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12623,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓行","author":"缪公恩","text":"唱罢村鸡夜已阑，霜风刮面敝裘寒。\n朝霞有意迎归骑，一片轻红上马鞍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12624,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"首山","author":"缪公恩","text":"三峰倚汉翠屏开，峰顶犹存古燧台。\n白首老兵言往事，少年曾拾宝刀来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12625,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望虹螺山","author":"缪公恩","text":"天收海雾拥朱轮，习习微风起细尘。\n数朵芙蓉天外落，虹螺山翠笑迎人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12626,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"缪公恩","text":"有客携琴策蹇归，奚童却扫闭柴扉。\n西窗小醉斜阳暖，一任阶前落叶飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12627,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿双峰寺","author":"缪公恩","text":"南峰烟接北峰阴，树影迎车暮色沈。\n夜磬一声闻梵贝，春潭千尺净尘心。\n幻缘结梦何时醒，妙境宜人得契深。\n山月满窗清不寐，长吟无复睡魔侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12628,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访李松峰维翰","author":"缪公恩","text":"水映霞光浪影红，伊人门在夕阳东。\n兴来不用山阴棹，芳径携筇趁晚风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12629,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为立亭十二弟题画兰 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"白石清溪寄迹深，红芽惟傍碧苔阴。\n洛阳锦绣知多少，谁向空山结素心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12630,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"为立亭十二弟题画兰 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"擎空峭壁对晴晖，附有芳兰倚翠微。\n一霎天风岩畔过，幽香合向碧霄飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12631,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画兰","author":"缪公恩","text":"写兰不求似，不似亦非兰。\n似与不似间，素心千古寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12632,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦鹤轩夜坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"幽斋独坐夜融融，弄影檐花簌簌红。\n树密恰容窗纳月，帘疏不碍座当风。\n心涵静契神俱寂，思入虚灵念欲空。\n何处更寻仙境界，此身今在玉壶中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12633,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后郊行","author":"缪公恩","text":"马足青泥滑，迎人径草幽。\n远天拖雨脚，残日破云头。\n水泛山溪阔，烟低野树稠。\n农夫看得意，蓑笠叱黄牛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12634,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"学廨漫吟 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"潾潾泮水细生波，绿影参差掩芰荷。\n斗室最宜新雨后，薰风凉到北窗多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12635,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"学廨漫吟 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"断云拖雨过高城，帘捲虚斋素壁明。\n绿树绕檐人寂寂，独凭小榻听禽声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12636,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答梁鹤庄 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"三十年来感逝波，浮云身世变更多。\n故人零落青门旧，白发盈头唤奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12637,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答梁鹤庄 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"曾同诸子共趋庭，朝退追随过引亭。\n杖履于今魂梦里，不堪回首忆横经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12638,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答梁鹤庄 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"骑箕化鹤已神仙，两母云山隔一天。\n安得老人相晤对，与君同侍话当年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12639,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答梁鹤庄 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"司鹾作宰为家贫，清俸重颁足养亲。\n枢要遗徽今具在，期君衣钵继先人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12640,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答梁鹤庄 其五","author":"缪公恩","text":"法书分我浣溪笺，属领风花雪月权。\n俗骨自来医不得，此中清旷恐无缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12641,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答梁鹤庄 其六","author":"缪公恩","text":"海角迢迢忆索居，故人应亦念吾庐。\n见君不待梁头月，斗室常悬尺素书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12642,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮行山中","author":"缪公恩","text":"曲折寻幽径，青山拥去鞭。\n溪深新雨后，草乱晚风前。\n残照下高树，暮鸦归远天。\n柴门何处是，漠漠隔炊烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12643,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"一月以来连绵霪雨闷中成句","author":"缪公恩","text":"匝月曾无五日晴，霪霖何以慰舆情。\n湿云低欲齐檐堕，积水深恒没砌平。\n泥落空梁饥燕语，烟销沈灶怒蛙鸣。\n疏棂半启书床暗，吟望元穹太瘦生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12644,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蒿镫次立亭十二弟韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"折得蒌蒿植院庭，乱悬香炷火光荧。\n迷离珠树迎人艳，缥缈檀香拂面青。\n□地欲成三里雾，映空疑落满天星。\n却猜月黑雷塘夜，散出隋宫万斛萤。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12645,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"默坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"默坐心神静，虚窗片月悬。\n帘波三尺水，炉篆一痕烟。\n凉露坠高树，素河明远天。\n此中清妙境，无隙入尘缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12646,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"齿落","author":"缪公恩","text":"颊辅相依五十秋，一朝辞去少迟留。\n咀含曾未知书味，摇落由来逊舌柔。\n已向膏粱恣大嚼，不随林壑漱清流。\n于今尔我无关涉，征汇毋贻同类忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12647,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题醉仙图","author":"缪公恩","text":"洞里烟霞岁月多，桑田几见涌沧波。\n先生不是贪酣醉，自向乾坤养太和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12648,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀朝鲜李鲁山金清山诸君","author":"缪公恩","text":"庭树风凉又仲秋，去年同此话瀛洲。\n辞华各擅无双艳，品格都居第一筹。\n鸭绿江涛流别恨，神嵩山月照离愁。\n贲然何日重酬酢，共解相思溯旧游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12649,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜大风继之以雨甚寒","author":"缪公恩","text":"风伯号空逞怒威，青镫短榻闭双扉。\n骚人影共秋花瘦，落叶声兼冻雨飞。\n万里有书鸿雁冷，九霄无路梦魂归。\n醉吟拟欲驱寒去，玉粟生肌酒力微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12650,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"高楼有美人，容华明月光。\n丹黄无所施，缟素为衣裳。\n空帷独自悲，徘徊下高堂。\n愿得一心人，相共成七襄。\n殷勤结女伴，朝夕相颉颃。\n学为好笑嚬，亦为时世妆。\n无如非本真，徒劳回寸肠。\n敛手谢流辈，愿言归洞房。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12651,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"洞房有鸣琴，朱弦多古音。\n一鼓再三叹，聊以慰悲心。\n明月照素颜，清风吹缟衿。\n徘徊复徘徊，夜寒更漏沈。\n青春不我留，霜华双鬓侵。\n盥手理残机，爱此一寸阴。\n蛾眉不入时，人情自古今。\n修绠汲寒泉，相将此意深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12652,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"窈窕启明窗，罗帷风自开。\n素月西复西，所观殊未来。\n置我黄金梭，敛我明镜台。\n锦瑟一再弹，弦外有馀哀。\n言笑日以远，容华日以摧。\n与子结相思，素心终不回。\n霜气树高空，木叶飞林隈。\n揽衣不成眠，空阁起徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12653,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋末暮行山中","author":"缪公恩","text":"到处萧条秋意阑，荻花枫叶已凋残。\n烟凝平野山岚紫，风拂疏林日影寒。\n新雪销融泥滑滑，远镫明灭路漫漫。\n苍茫暮霭迷荒径，赖有星光上马鞍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12654,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归自南村","author":"缪公恩","text":"归骑成新句，禅关访旧踪。\n断碑青藓合，画壁暗尘封。\n叶尽山容瘦，云寒雪意浓。\n马蹄残日里，缥缈听清钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12655,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与从弟德基话旧","author":"缪公恩","text":"瞬息韶华慨逝波，世情几许眼前过。\n也知名士尝题凤，不信书生解化鹅。\n混俗祇今聊复尔，谋生到此竟如何。\n自来白发无公道，偏向愁人顶上多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12656,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尚铁峰来访","author":"缪公恩","text":"每依斗柄望文軿，忽报柴关小驷停。\n魂梦空劳寻酒国，烟花好共叩诗扃。\n三春莺侣迁乔木，六月鹏抟息北溟。\n此际与君舒别悃，不须重忆短长亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12657,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万泉河夜步","author":"缪公恩","text":"月色明如许，幽寻性所耽。\n花光浮夜气，星影浸春潭。\n古寺清钟歇，长堤野径谙。\n携筇吟未已，已过小桥南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12658,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独酌漫吟","author":"缪公恩","text":"仕为贫驱亦奈何，年华空自悔蹉跎。\n人情冷淡黄金尽，诗句苍凉白发多。\n混俗祇宜醒且醉，闭关直欲哭当歌。\n葛巾且漉新醅酒，小梦迷离养太和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12659,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感吟","author":"缪公恩","text":"田中植嘉苗，墙头生野草。\n人功与地力，无须较多少。\n十日不得雨，长空日杲杲。\n墙头草正青，田中苗欲槁。\n此理殊难测，郁郁伤怀抱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12660,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中","author":"缪公恩","text":"野路青山外，孤村白水边。\n树迷芳草渡，烟淡夕阳天。\n车马劳长道，波涛感逝川。\n何如滩上叟，高卧钓鱼船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12661,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶感","author":"缪公恩","text":"子晋吹箫便得仙，玉炉金鼎总虚传。\n迩来自悟长生诀，祇取莺花乐眼前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12662,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"骆驼","author":"缪公恩","text":"肿背从教辨是非，铁衣曾载美人归。\n而今不用驰千里，牧向春郊草正肥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12663,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晓","author":"缪公恩","text":"峭寒入夜逼窗纱，敲彻晨钟静不哗。\n老树迷离横瘦影，半天残月听啼鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12664,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"漠漠秋空雁几行，晚烟浮动月昏黄。\n凭窗瘦骨支离甚，落叶风多纸帐凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12665,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中偶成","author":"缪公恩","text":"久病精神减，无心问物华。\n目昏看字误，腕弱作书斜。\n小径馀残菊，凉烟点暮鸦。\n萧萧衰柳叶，历乱打窗纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12666,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭寿安表弟","author":"缪公恩","text":"霜落金台柿叶丹，秋镫相对夜初寒。\n君能身作芝兰客，我只竽吹苜蓿盘。\n有母存孤生已幸，无儿承后死应难。\n空馀匣里端溪砚，鸲鹆双枯泪眼乾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12667,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜独坐有怀三弟伟","author":"缪公恩","text":"凉云漠漠作清阴，静听閒庭众籁吟。\n落叶打窗秋渐老，疏钟敲梦漏初深。\n燕台夜雪三年别，闽海西风万里心。\n为嘱冥鸿劳寄语，有人天末望乡音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12668,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪后行东山道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"积素凝辉远近同，行人直在玉山中。\n青光飞出群峰外，寒逼残阳淡不红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12669,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归自东山","author":"缪公恩","text":"驱车入平陆，人在万山西。\n野旷飘风急，云昏落日低。\n孤烟横远坞，古渡锁寒溪。\n遥指高城近，疏镫树影迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12670,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除日得三弟公伟书知暂知瓯宁县事值有海盗蔡牵朱濆之警","author":"缪公恩","text":"南云望断旅鸿疏，一纸飞来正岁除。\n五十三龄双雪鬓，七千馀里万金书。\n烽传闽海严新令，梦阻仙霞绕故庐。\n忆得屠苏谋共醉，寸函相对意何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12671,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]